<Layout title="About" active="About" description="About Will Gao, a computer science and mathematics student at the University of Washington whose interests are shifting toward empirical AI.">
  <div class="page-intro"><h1>About</h1></div>
  <div class="about-grid"><div class="prose">
    <p>I’m Will Gao, entering my fourth year in the University of Washington’s computer science BS/MS program and also majoring in pure mathematics. This summer, I worked as an applied scientist intern at Madrona Venture Group, where I researched and built founder-discovery algorithms and systems for investors.</p>
    <p>My interests were previously in combinatorial optimization and probability; I’m now shifting toward empirical AI.</p>
    <p>I’m looking for a model-focused machine learning engineering role at a startup, or a research residency, for June 2027–June 2028. I’ll return to UW in Autumn 2028 for the master’s year of the BS/MS program.</p>
    <p>I also write about <a href={withBase('/writing/')}>musical theater</a>.</p>
    <p>This autumn, I’ll be a teaching assistant for <a href={withBase('/teaching/')}>CSE 422: Advanced Toolkit for Modern Algorithms</a>.</p>
    <div class="intro-links"><CvLink/><a href="mailto:wgaostudio@gmail.com">Email</a></div>
  </div><img class="portrait" src={withBase('/portrait.jpg')} alt="Will Gao" width="200" height="270"/></div>
